+## NiriFX preset folder
+
+[NiriFX](https://github.com/jturbide/niri-fx) exports configurable fragment, slice
+and elastic open/close shaders for niri. From a current NiriFX checkout:
+
+```sh
+python3 -m niri_fx export-pack --output ~/.config/niri/nirifx-presets --apply
+```
+
+Set `presets_dir` to `~/.config/niri/nirifx-presets` and `include_prefix` to
+`./nirifx-presets` when `target_file` is `~/.config/niri/animations.kdl`.
+Select a preset here to activate it. Exporting the folder does not change the
+active desktop, and the generated presets leave resize effects off.
+
+The [NiriFX setup guide](https://github.com/jturbide/niri-fx/blob/main/docs/noctalia.md)
+explains include ordering, ownership, updates and restore.
+
